COMMENT ON TABLE "public"."post_tags" IS 'People tagged in a post. status pending|approved are publicly readable and both render as "with <name>" on the post header (owner ruling 2026-08-10, "show immediately to public"); declined|removed are visible only to the tagger, the tagged member and the post owner, and are never rendered. The tagged member may set status to removed at ANY time from the post menu - "tagged person only can remove my Tag anytime" - which is what makes publishing a pending tag safe.';



